OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies murder charge over
OL,4,Afatal A1(M) crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has denied murdering a woman
OL,7,Ffollowing a two-vehicle crash on the
OL,8,FA1(M) in North Yorkshire.
OL,10,FElena Chiriac, 22, from Newcastle, died
OL,11,Fwhen a silver Ford Transit and a silver
OL,12,FVolkswagen Golf collided on the
OL,13,Fsouthbound carriageway on 4 October in
OL,14,Fthe Barton area, north of Scotch
OL,15,FCorner.
OL,17,FAppearing via videolink at Leeds Crown
OL,18,FCourt, Florin Chiriac, 31, from
OL,19,FNewcastle, pleaded not guilty to
OL,20,Fmurder, causing death by dangerous
OL,21,Fdriving and attempted grievous bodily
OL,22,Fharm.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
